Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?=F0=9F=8E=A8=20Telegram=20Mini=20Apps:=20safe-a?=
 =?UTF-8?q?rea-inset,=20viewport-fit,=20viewportHeight=20sync?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add viewport-fit: cover for notch/system UI support
- Sync Telegram WebApp.viewportHeight to --telegram-viewport-height CSS var
- Add safe-area-inset padding to html/body/header/footer for edge protection
- Update BottomNav with safe-area-inset-bottom (min 0.5rem fallback)
- Add viewportChanged event listener to dynamically adapt height
- Fix BottomNav safe-area utility class

Fixes rendering issues when app is displayed in Telegram's constrained viewport.
